          "value": "<p>If the enemy is a demon, devil, or undead, it must make a normal save (11+) or temporarily return to its home plane or grave (or another thematically appropriate venue of retreat). It may return in the next encounter, or at any point thereafter; when it does so, it possesses a new relationship point from an icon with which you have either a negative or conflicted relationship (or no relationship). The enemy can roll this relationship point immediately, benefitting from it in that encounter.</p>"
